    <!-- Project 1 -->
     <h1> The Genesis of An Idea </h1>
     <p> Sometime around a year and a half ago, I came up with the idea to make it easier for myself and other teachers to write language objectives.</p>
    <h2>Born From UX Design Projects</h2>
    <p>The idea really came from my UX course. I'd made a powerpoint on stress management but I felt like it wasn't really marketable. Then one day I came across a blog where UX designers were talking about how they'd developed their trade.</p>
    <p>Someone was talking about how she'd made a bird call app that taught users to understand bird calls in their neighborhood. She'd started by sketching out the idea and then learned some coding to make it a reality. Wow! I thought. This could be something I could do.</p>


    <div class="row align-items-center mb-5">
