        <strong>Figma</strong>
         <p>
            Googling/Asking AI led me over to a website called 
            <a href="https://www.figma.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Figma</a>.
            Figma is a website where you can start planning something out. 
            My earliest slide was this one. I knew that I wanted to have a link 
            to WIDA, finished language objectives for teachers to view, and 
            the possibility of creating your own.
          </p>
