        <strong>Basic Viewing Mode and Learning Figma</strong>
         <p>
          I knew what I wanted the view mode to look like and it was pretty basic. Just one Language Objective per slide and a next and back button along with a create objective button. </p>
          <p>Learning how to manipulate the tools in Figma took me some time, but it was cool to see how an artist/creator could use Figma to dream up great ideas.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

