        <strong>Flow or Storyboarding</strong>
         <p>
            From there, I began sketching out my basic flow or storyboard for the create aspect of the app. For an idea of what storyboarding is, Wikipedia provides a pretty good start
            <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Storyboard" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Wikipedia-storyboarding</a>. My goal was to create an app called the <strong>Combiner</strong>  that in the end would combine everything together. 
          </p>
